1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:01,780
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:03,460
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:05,100
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,660
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,620
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,380
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:13,740
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,460
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,180
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,820
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,540
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,180
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,500
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,340
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,740
=The One=

16
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,260
=Episode 13=

17
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:50,880
Learn how to kiss yet?

18
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,680
I'll teach you.

19
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:53,280
No.

20
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:56,640
Why won't you let me kiss you?

21
00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,840
Not even in a dream?

22
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:03,160
Why do you want to kiss me?

23
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:06,200
Because...

24
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,400
I like you.

25
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,000
You like me?

26
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:18,760
W-would just any guy do?

27
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,220
Do you know me?

28
00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:21,120
Do you know who I am?

29
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,960
Aren't you Cheng Lin?

30
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,640
You like Cheng Lin?

31
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,500
Mm.

32
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,760
Then why did you...

33
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,780
My mom...

34
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:41,880
What did my mom say to you?

35
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,880
What did she say to you?

36
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:49,420
♪I replay it all again in my mind♪

37
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:52,900
♪Is it hard to forget what I never had?♪

38
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:56,420
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

39
00:01:56,420 --> 00:02:00,420
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

40
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,120
Why won't you let me kiss you?

41
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:04,160
Is it because I'm older?

42
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:06,880
Or because you think I'm...

43
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:09,080
dirty?

44
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,400
Tell me.

45
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,160
What is Cheng Lin to you?

46
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:04,720
(My head hurts. Everything hurts.)

47
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:06,120
(Why am I so tired?)

48
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:08,640
Morning.

49
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,880
Tired?

50
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,600
(Did time rewind?)

51
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,120
Sit down.

52
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:15,640
(Why is he...)

53
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:23,900
(Why wouldn't you let me kiss you?)

54
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:35,840
Drink some water first.

55
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,680
I was drunk last night.

56
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,360
That was my fault.

57
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:53,760
After breakfast,

58
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,400
you should head home.

59
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,860
(Cheng Lin is mine. - Su Yan)

60
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,880
(Cheng Lin is mine.)

61
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,080
(I want to kiss him.)

62
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,320
(And sleep with him.)

63
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,120
Delete that. That's private.

64
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:27,120
Then sue me.

65
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:27,840
I'll face the consequences.

66
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:28,360
You...

67
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:50,780
(Master of the law,
yet a master of seduction.)

68
00:04:50,780 --> 00:04:53,780
(All skill, no morals.)

69
00:04:53,780 --> 00:04:56,300
(Campus seductress. Homewrecker.)

70
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:58,900
(Su Yan.)

71
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:00,460
(Tell me.)

72
00:05:00,460 --> 00:05:02,340
(What would make you feel better?)

73
00:05:02,340 --> 00:05:05,720
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

74
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:09,240
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

75
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:12,760
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

76
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:16,520
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

77
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:35,000
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

78
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:38,640
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

79
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:41,840
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

80
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:45,520
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

81
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:48,920
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

82
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:52,600
♪I hum this song alone♪

83
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:56,440
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

84
00:05:56,440 --> 00:06:00,520
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

85
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:03,800
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

86
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:07,400
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

87
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:10,880
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

88
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:15,760
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
